{"id": "spp-cloze-0003", "lang": "spp", "masked_text": "Mii fànhe na [MASK] mu à jwo lwɔhɔ ku ɲyɛ na fwu na ntùuli, mii kaciiyi punʼà cúnŋɔ cúnŋʼa láha yiye na. Mii zòŋʼà ɲa mii funŋke e mu à jwo kùro.", "target": "ŋkɛ̀ɛge", "choices": {"A": "ŋkɛ̀ɛ", "B": "ŋkɛ̀ɛge", "C": "ntùntaɲɛɛbii", "D": "yamube"}, "answer": "B", "distractor_types": ["bare_stem", "same_lang_inflected", "confusable_lang"]}
{"id": "spp-cloze-0004", "lang": "spp", "masked_text": "Mu [MASK] e, mu cwoŋi sí n-pyi mu à jwo ɛrɛzɛn cige ku ɲyɛ na seni ke, mu pyìibii sí mu talyige kwûulo, mu à jwo oliviye ciye yʼà fyîn kàavo.", "target": "pyɛnge", "choices": {"A": "Bɔɔngɔ", "B": "kampyi", "C": "pyɛn", "D": "pyɛnge"}, "answer": "D", "distractor_types": ["confusable_lang", "same_lang_inflected", "bare_stem"]}
