{"id": "spp-cloze-0006", "lang": "spp", "masked_text": "Numɛ sí u ta u à sà ŋwɔhɔ [MASK] kà, lire ɲyɛ mɛ, taŋwɔhɔge kabɛrʼe. Kàshige tasiige e pi aha wuu shiinbii pìi bò, sùpyire sí n-wyɛ̀rɛ yire lógo, si jwo: “Pi à Abisalɔn kàshikwɔɔnbii pìi bò.”", "target": "ɲaŋgyige", "choices": {"A": "gbura", "B": "ɲaŋgyi", "C": "teritoriyaliibi", "D": "ɲaŋgyige"}, "answer": "D", "distractor_types": ["confusable_lang", "bare_stem", "same_lang_inflected"]}
